    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald O'Donovan are delighted to bring to the market 67 Tola Park, Shannon, a two-bedroom semi-detached bungalow ideally located in a mature and established residential area in the heart of Shannon.\n\nThe property offers well-proportioned accommodation comprising an open-plan kitchen and dining area, living room, two bedrooms and a main bathroom. While the property would benefit from some modernisation and upgrading, it provides an excellent opportunity for a purchaser to put their own stamp on a home in a highly convenient location.\n\nTo the rear, the property benefits from a private patio area and on-site parking.\n\nThe location is a major feature of this property, with the Skycourt Shopping Centre located directly across the road, providing a wide range of shops, cafés, restaurants and other amenities. A host of further local services and facilities are also within easy reach, while Shannon's established road network provides convenient access to surrounding areas.\n\nThe property would make an ideal home for those looking to downsize, a first-time buyer or an investor seeking a property in a well-established and convenient location.\n\nViewing is recommended without delay to appreciate the accommodation and location on offer."
      },
